            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>After your first successful export, WatermarkFactory now offers to walk you through adding a Finder right-click Quick Action for next time -- in-app step-by-step instructions, no automatic filesystem changes.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
