        <item>
            <title>1.1.8</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 11:32:04 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>New Watermark Intensity control on the Position stage: six named steps from Discrete to Protective (size + opacity + layout together), sized from real market research (10-15% of canvas width is the professional-branding sweet spot). Chip row plus a slider that interpolates between steps.</li>
                    <li>The preview now shows Automality's own mark when you haven't chosen a watermark yet, so the intensity presets are actually visible before you have your own logo ready. Clearly badged as a demo -- never used for a real export.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/cadavidf/WatermarkFactory/releases/download/v1.1.8/WatermarkFactory.dmg" length="2318551" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="h/zqGTuPq0oaGex4iDk1vpL2LqY8RxSXLMkFu2LnDArt9VzM2A2EpGyUs1HXgRyBb9IZvGsa6p8IVf+bgGjvCQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.1.7</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 11:19:02 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>The Watermark and Position steps are now separate, numbered stages instead of one combined step -- choose the watermark first, then a dedicated Position step for size/opacity/layout/padding, matching the progress nav for the first time.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
